## At a glance

| | |
| --- | --- |
| **Chip** | XMPL100 temperature switch |
| **Does** | Asserts OUT (open drain, active low) above its trip point, 85 °C typical |
| **Bus** | None: GPIO only, OUT to an MCU input |
| **Also drives** | SHDN_N, when your port has `GpioSet()`; then `EnsureInitialized()` checks the self-test pulse |
| **Driver** | Header-only C++20; no heap, exceptions, RTTI or virtual calls; every call returns `Result<T>` |
| **Runs on** | Any MCU with GPIO and a C++20 compiler; the host example runs on any PC ([Platforms](docs/platforms.md)) |
| **Status** | 0.1.0, not yet verified on hardware: host-tested against a model of the pins |

