## Tests and quality

```bash
cmake -S . -B build -DXMPL100_BUILD_TESTS=ON && cmake --build build && ctest --test-dir build
```

The host tests run the driver against a model of the pins and produce each error the driver can return. CI also builds
for Cortex-M and checks coverage, complexity, sanitizers, clang-tidy and the handbook rules (`.kokeb/handbook.yml`). See
[Testing and CI](docs/testing.md).

